  "opacity_data_source": "PLATON v6.3.1 data/Absorption R20k arrays (including the archived CS2 table), 40 temperatures 100\u20134000 K, 13 pressures 1e-4\u20131e8 Pa; downsample20 and retain points in eight bins plus the original domain endpoints. All stored per-species log cross sections were verified exactly against these source tables.",
